## 📖 Overview

Task Compass is a browser-based learning experience that helps users understand how work flows inside organizations. Instead of testing job titles, it focuses on ownership, delegation, collaboration, escalation, and workflow thinking through an engaging simulation.

Built as a single-file HTML application, it works completely offline without any external libraries or APIs.

---

## ✨ Features

- 🎯 Three interactive gameplay stages
- 🧩 Drag-and-drop task management
- 👥 Role ownership simulation
- 🔄 Task routing workflows
- 🤝 Collaboration challenges
- 📊 Understanding dashboard with progress chart
- 🌙 Premium dark mode UI
- 💎 Glassmorphism design
- 📱 Fully responsive layout
- ⚡ Offline support

